alabofur (1.1.0) jammy; urgency=medium

  * New `alabofur top` command: live download/upload rate per interface,
    share of the configured limit in use, packets dropped by shaping and
    the processes using the most TCP bandwidth (refreshed every second).
  * The help screen now shows the live rate and configured limit of every
    interface under the logo.

 -- Tuncay Bahadır <tuncaybahadir@protonmail.com>  Sat, 24 Oct 2026 16:30:00 +0000

