alabofur (1.0.2) jammy; urgency=medium

  * Security hardening (GitHub issue #1):
    - validate interface names before passing them to tc/ip or using them
      as config file names;
    - write config files under umask 077 (directory 0700, files 0600);
    - use mktemp for captured command stderr instead of a fixed name;
    - add SECURITY.md with a vulnerability reporting process;
    - run shellcheck in the release workflow before building.
  * Show a coloured banner above the help text on UTF-8 terminals.
  * Drop the Snap packaging.

 -- Tuncay Bahadır <tuncaybahadir@protonmail.com>  Sat, 24 Oct 2026 13:00:00 +0000

